      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Coherence Enforcer\n\n**Guardian of meaning.**\n\nThis agent protects the semantics of Twilite.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n- enforce primitive contracts\n- reject invalid structures\n- prevent semantic corruption\n- identify when meaning collapses\n- make sure UI and AI authoring remain aligned\n\nThis is Sterling’s quiet power: he does not merely advise. He preserves coherence.",
